<title>USA: Nationwide Insurance plans &quot;major&quot; announcement.</title>
<headline>Nationwide Insurance plans &quot;major&quot; announcement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nationwide Insurance said Friday  it will make a &quot;major announcement&quot; at 1000 EST today about Nationwide Insurance property and casualty companies plans for urban markets.</p>
<p>The announcement will be made by Richard Crabtree, president of Nationwide Property and Casualty, in a press conference in Columbus, Ohio, the company said.</p>
</text>
